    "https://www.colum.edu/careers-and-alumni/industry-opportunities": {
      "title": "Ready to Work with Industry Leaders?",
      "description": "Industry Partnerships | Columbia College Chicago Skip to main content Academics Schools Audio and Music Business and Entrepreneurship Communication and Culture Design Fashion Film and Television Theatre and Dance Visual Arts Programs Majors Minors Graduate Certificate Pre-College Programs Immersive Studies Study Abroad Semester in LA Comedy Studies Academic Resources Academic Advising Academic Calendar Catalog Experential Learning Library Our Faculty Student Tools MyColumbia Portal Canvas Engage IT Assistance Student Hub Admissions + Financial Aid Why Choose Columbia? Chicago: Our City and Campus World-Class Facilities Faculty Mentors and Makers Industry Connections Alumni Success Student Work How to Apply Freshman Transfer Graduate International Second Bachelor's Returning Students Nondegree Seeking Portfolio and Audition Requirements Cost + Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate Orientation Visit Us Campus Visits Virtual Tours Student Experience Campus Life Student Center Student Organizations Athletics and Recreation Student Spotlights Events on Campus Manifest Arts Festival Housing + Living Campus Housing Options Office of Housing and Residential Experience Living in Chicago Campus Facilities Campus Map Services + Support Campus Safety and Security Student Health Support Services MyColumbia Portal Information Technology Student Handbook Student Success Student Financial Services Academic Advising Belonging and Persistence Holistic Support Career Outcomes Career Advising Alumni Success Rankings and Awards About About the College Facts Mission and History Rankings and Awards Academic Access and Excellence Strategic Plan Contact Us Leadership Office of the President Office of the Provost Board of Trustees News + Events Columbia Stories Media Mentions Event Spotlight 135th Anniversary Media Resources Careers + Alumni Career Center Internships Job Board Industry Partnerships Alumni Success The Alumni Network Get Info Apply Visit Give Search colum.edu Quick Links MyColumbia Canvas Library Academic Calendar Commencement Campus Map Building Hours Resources For Current Students Prospective Students Parents and Families Student Counselors and Advocates Faculty and Staff Alumni Donors Employers Health + Safety Campus Safety and Security Health Services Center for Student Wellbeing Services for Students with Disabilities Report a Concern Get Connected Give to Columbia Work at Columbia Hire from Columbia Directory Contact Us Get Info Apply Visit Give Search and quick links Open navigation menu Ready to Work with Industry Leaders? Imagine turning classroom theory into real-world experience with top companies like L’Oréal, NASCAR, and Hilton Hotels and Resorts. Columbia College Chicago doesn’t just teach creative disciplines; we connect you to the industries that use them. Working with our vast network of industry partners can help you get a head start on your career, including: Real-world experience Columbia College Chicago gives you access to the creative world you’re passionate about. Forget textbook scenarios—you’ll gain practical experience by collaborating with industry professionals on real-world projects. These collaborations allow you to apply your skills in a tangible way and offer valuable industry exposure through internships and project partnerships. Portfolio power Your projects and experiences at Columbia will feed directly into your portfolio. You’ll create a collection of work that showcases your talent, technical skills, and problem-solving abilities—all directly relevant to your desired industry. This will become your calling card, setting you apart from the competition when you apply for jobs or freelance opportunities. Network advantage At Columbia, you’ll be surrounded by inspiring peers, dedicated faculty, and industry professionals. These connections create a powerful network that can open doors to future opportunities. You’ll build lasting relationships with classmates, mentors, and industry partners that can lead to job recommendations, collaborations, and a supportive network as you launch your career. OUR INDUSTRY PARTNERS Concept to Consumer Columbia students partnered with YKK, Browzwear, and SOUNDOFF to design inclusive bridalwear and custom Chicago Sky fan apparel—real-world projects powered by industry collaboration. Students Bring Gift Bag Designs to Market Students at Columbia College Chicago learn the art and business of design thanks to partnership with gift bag seller Dipak and marketing firm Madak . Agency: Students Deliver Real-World Marketing Campaigns In this Columbia-produced video, students in Kevin Christophersen’s “Agency” class discuss the marketing strategies, ads, social media plans, and other deliverables they developed to created integrated campaigns for real-world startup clients. Columbia College Chicago Students Experience the Ultimate Field Trip Business and Entrepreneurship students take their education beyond the classroom each year at SXSW , gaining practical experience working with real clients. From Classroom to Industry: Students Lead at Unleashed 2023 Columbia bridges the classroom and career by partnering with industry leaders, like those behind Unleashed 2023’s activations, where Business and Entrepreneurship students received course credit for their hands-on planning and design work. Columbia Students Partner With Patagonia for Worn Wear Competition Patagonia partnered with Columbia students to showcase innovative designs, all crafted from recycled Patagonia materials. The project highlighted the intersection of fashion and environmental responsibility. Columbia Team Wins U.S. L’Oréal Brandstorm Competition for Fourth Year in a Row Columbia College Chicago were named the U.S. winners of L’Oréal Brandstorm, an annual international student competition that gives students the chance to tackle a real business case, gain new skills, and engage with industry experts. Columbia Students Partner With NASCAR Chicago to Create Race-Themed Games NASCAR Chicago Street Race partnered with Columbia students to create family-friendly interactive digital activities and a print publication for the Chicago street race. Illustration Student Creates Sweet Design for Fannie May Fannie May Chocolates unveiled the newest iteration of their Chicago Line. The packaging is designed by Illustration alum Katelyn McManis ‘22 and features the city’s most iconic landmarks. McManis was connected to this early career opportunity through The Career Center. Read More Visit Career Center Columbia College Chicago homepage Columbia College Chicago Instagram Columbia College Chicago Facebook Columbia College Chicago LinkedIn Columbia College Chicago YouTube Academics Admissions + Financial Aid Student Experience About Careers & Alumni INFO FOR Students Faculty and Staff Parents Alumni Contact Us Academics Schools Majors & Programs Academic Calendar Our Faculty Request Info Admissions + Financial Aid Application Requirements Portfolios and Auditions Financial Aid Scholarships Apply Student Experience Housing Campus Facilities Support Services Student Success Visit About News Events Rankings and Awards Mission and History Report a Concern Careers & Alumni Alumni Success Career Center Industry Opportunities The Alumni Network Give © 2026 Columbia College Chicago Directory Site Map Privacy Policy Accessibility Consumer Information Accreditation Suggest an Edit × ×"
