      "description": "Career Center | Columbia College Chicago Skip to main content Academics Schools Audio and Music Business and Entrepreneurship Communication and Culture Design Fashion Film and Television Theatre and Dance Visual Arts Programs Majors Minors Graduate Certificate Pre-College Programs Immersive Studies Study Abroad Semester in LA Comedy Studies Academic Resources Academic Advising Academic Calendar Catalog Experential Learning Library Our Faculty Student Tools MyColumbia Portal Canvas Engage IT Assistance Student Hub Admissions + Financial Aid Why Choose Columbia? Chicago: Our City and Campus World-Class Facilities Faculty Mentors and Makers Industry Connections Alumni Success Student Work How to Apply Freshman Transfer Graduate International Second Bachelor's Returning Students Nondegree Seeking Portfolio and Audition Requirements Cost + Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate Orientation Visit Us Campus Visits Virtual Tours Student Experience Campus Life Student Center Student Organizations Athletics and Recreation Student Spotlights Events on Campus Manifest Arts Festival Housing + Living Campus Housing Options Office of Housing and Residential Experience Living in Chicago Campus Facilities Campus Map Services + Support Campus Safety and Security Student Health Support Services MyColumbia Portal Information Technology Student Handbook Student Success Student Financial Services Academic Advising Belonging and Persistence Holistic Support Career Outcomes Career Advising Alumni Success Rankings and Awards About About the College Facts Mission and History Rankings and Awards Academic Access and Excellence Strategic Plan Contact Us Leadership Office of the President Office of the Provost Board of Trustees News + Events Columbia Stories Media Mentions Event Spotlight 135th Anniversary Media Resources Careers + Alumni Career Center Internships Job Board Industry Partnerships Alumni Success The Alumni Network Get Info Apply Visit Give Search colum.edu Quick Links MyColumbia Canvas Library Academic Calendar Commencement Campus Map Building Hours Resources For Current Students Prospective Students Parents and Families Student Counselors and Advocates Faculty and Staff Alumni Donors Employers Health + Safety Campus Safety and Security Health Services Center for Student Wellbeing Services for Students with Disabilities Report a Concern Get Connected Give to Columbia Work at Columbia Hire from Columbia Directory Contact Us Get Info Apply Visit Give Search and quick links Open navigation menu Career Center Career Center Student Overview Employer Overview Alumni Parents & Families Events and Programs Meet the Staff Career Center Career Center Students Student Overview Career Advising Internships Online Job Board On-Campus Employment Career Resources Employers Employer Overview Hire from Columbia Fairs & Industry Events Host an Intern for Credit Partner With Us Employer Conduct Alumni Parents & Families Events and Programs Meet the Staff Location Student Center 754 S. Wabash, 3rd Floor 312-369-7280 careercenter@colum.edu Office Hours Monday–Friday 9am–5pm Walk-in Resume Reviews Monday–Friday 10am–4:30pm Make an appointment on ColumWorks Creative careers start here. Take advantage of the Columbia Career Center’s extensive resources to help prepare for life after college. Whether you’re a current student, an alumnus, an employer, or a family member supporting your student’s career journey, the Career Center is here to engage and prepare the next generation of creatives. We offer personalized career advising, access to job & internship postings, industry resources, and walk-in resume and cover letter reviews daily. Our team is committed to facilitating opportunities and supporting your success through networking events, industry-specific advising, and more. Together, we help guide you toward a rewarding career, starting with the resources and connections that the Columbia community provides. Recent Grad Career Outcomes 96% employed or achieving creative success within a year 65% completed one or more internships 75% working in their major, related creative field, or using creative skills *For more information visit colum.edu/effectiveness . “The internship with Apple Studios was a fantastic experience that developed me both professionally and personally. Working alongside their talented and creative team, I learned more about the entertainment industry and the opportunities I can pursue moving forward. The Career Center has been a tremendous support as I plan my career after graduation.” Sam Santana BFA Film and Television - Screenwriting ’25 Summer Development Intern, Apple Studios \"Working with Netflix has been an absolute honor, and a life-changing experience. I am forever grateful for my team that took me in and introduced me to the post-production world. Coming into Columbia with the very little knowledge of how to put my work together, where to begin, and how to move forward with the skills I learned within my classes, the Career Center knew exactly how to help me navigate my way through finding and preparing for this first internship.\" Kara Dominique Garcia BFA Traditional Animation, Minor in Illustration ’25 Screening Operations Intern, Netflix \"My internship with Arrival Artists has been an incredible opportunity that’s helping me expand my knowledge of the live music industry and talent representation. I’ve been collaborating with their passionate and dedicated team and gaining valuable insights into artist bookings and agency operations. The Career Center has helped shape my path and assist me in finding opportunities that fit my career aspirations perfectly!\" Cassidy Pihera BA Marketing, Minor in Music Business ‘25 Artist Management Intern, Arrival Artists Our Services Students Industry-specific career advising Resume and cover letter reviews Recruiting and networking events Online job board with opportunities for creatives Company presentations, workshops, and industry panels Internships for credit On-campus jobs Employers Recruit students & alumni Host an intern Partner with us Alumni Search jobs online Access career resources Hire from Columbia Parents & Families Guide your student Encourage career engagement Hire from Columbia Quick Links internships for credit make an appointment on-campus employment hire from columbia career events partner with us Columbia College Chicago homepage Columbia College Chicago Instagram Columbia College Chicago Facebook Columbia College Chicago LinkedIn Columbia College Chicago YouTube Academics Admissions + Financial Aid Student Experience About Careers & Alumni INFO FOR Students Faculty and Staff Parents Alumni Contact Us Academics Schools Majors & Programs Academic Calendar Our Faculty Request Info Admissions + Financial Aid Application Requirements Portfolios and Auditions Financial Aid Scholarships Apply Student Experience Housing Campus Facilities Support Services Student Success Visit About News Events Rankings and Awards Mission and History Report a Concern Careers & Alumni Alumni Success Career Center Industry Opportunities The Alumni Network Give © 2026 Columbia College Chicago Directory Site Map Privacy Policy Accessibility Consumer Information Accreditation Suggest an Edit × ×"
