      "description": "Career Center | Columbia College Chicago Skip to main content Academics Schools Audio and Music Business and Entrepreneurship Communication and Culture Design Fashion Film and Television Theatre and Dance Visual Arts Programs Majors Minors Graduate Certificate Pre-College Programs Immersive Studies Study Abroad Semester in LA Comedy Studies Academic Resources Academic Advising Academic Calendar Catalog Experential Learning Library Our Faculty Student Tools MyColumbia Portal Canvas Engage IT Assistance Student Hub Admissions + Financial Aid Why Choose Columbia? Chicago: Our City and Campus World-Class Facilities Faculty Mentors and Makers Industry Connections Alumni Success Student Work How to Apply Freshman Transfer Graduate International Second Bachelor's Returning Students Nondegree Seeking Portfolio and Audition Requirements Cost + Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate Orientation Visit Us Campus Visits Virtual Tours Student Experience Campus Life Student Center Student Organizations Athletics and Recreation Student Spotlights Events on Campus Manifest Arts Festival Housing + Living Campus Housing Options Office of Housing and Residential Experience Living in Chicago Campus Facilities Campus Map Services + Support Campus Safety and Security Student Health Support Services MyColumbia Portal Information Technology Student Handbook Student Success Student Financial Services Academic Advising Belonging and Persistence Holistic Support Career Outcomes Career Advising Alumni Success Rankings and Awards About About the College Facts Mission and History Rankings and Awards Academic Access and Excellence Strategic Plan Contact Us Leadership Office of the President Office of the Provost Board of Trustees News + Events Columbia Stories Media Mentions Event Spotlight 135th Anniversary Media Resources Careers + Alumni Career Center Internships Job Board Industry Partnerships Alumni Success The Alumni Network Get Info Apply Visit Give Search colum.edu Quick Links MyColumbia Canvas Library Academic Calendar Commencement Campus Map Building Hours Resources For Current Students Prospective Students Parents and Families Student Counselors and Advocates Faculty and Staff Alumni Donors Employers Health + Safety Campus Safety and Security Health Services Center for Student Wellbeing Services for Students with Disabilities Report a Concern Get Connected Give to Columbia Work at Columbia Hire from Columbia Directory Contact Us Get Info Apply Visit Give Search and quick links Open navigation menu Employer Overview Employer Overview Hire from Columbia Fairs & Industry Events Host an Intern for Credit Partner With Us Employer Conduct Hire from Columbia Career Center Students Student Overview Career Advising Internships Online Job Board On-Campus Employment Career Resources Employers Employer Overview Hire from Columbia Fairs & Industry Events Host an Intern for Credit Partner With Us Employer Conduct Alumni Parents & Families Events and Programs Meet the Staff Location Student Center 754 S. Wabash, 3rd Floor 312-369-7280 careercenter@colum.edu Office Hours Monday–Friday 9am–5pm Walk-in Resume Reviews Monday–Friday 10am–4:30pm Make an appointment on ColumWorks Employers looking to hire for jobs and internships can recruit from Columbia several ways. To reach the diverse talent of Columbia students and alumni, post your opportunity to our online job and internship board, ColumWorks . Employers and jobs are reviewed by the Career Center to ensure they are in alignment with Columbia’s areas of study and recruiting policies. Not sure the best way to recruit from Columbia? Contact industryrelations@colum.edu and our Industry Relations team will work with you! Register on ColumWorks To register on our online job and internship board, ColumWorks, visit www.colum.12twenty.com/hire or email us with questions: industryrelations@colum.edu . Columbia College Chicago reserves the right to decline any employer or job. Employer accounts NOT eligible for approval include: Employers that offer services that are illegal according to Illinois state and/or federal law Organizations that charge fees for participation or placement, or require the purchase of product(s) or a financial investment Employers who are current undergraduate or graduate students Graduate and professional school programs Teaching English abroad programs Childcare Temp agencies Third-party recruiting firms Employer profiles that contain spelling or grammatical errors or are otherwise unprofessional Post a Job or Internship To register on our online job and internship board, ColumWorks, visit www.colum.12twenty.com/hire or email us with questions: industryrelations@colum.edu . *Before posting an internship, whether paid or unpaid, for academic credit or not, please review these internship guidelines . WRITING YOUR JOB DESCRIPTION A clear job description is essential to finding qualified applicants. Follow this outline to ensure you have a clear, detailed job posting and avoid any delays in approval. INCLUDE: Clear title and detailed duties/responsibilities Department and person the applicant will report to Brief summary of the position and its overarching responsibility or function within the organization Specific skills, experience, training, or other requirements for the job Educational requirements for the job, such as degrees and certifications Qualities or attributes that contribute to superior performance in the position Compensation Application instructions Need support? For more assistance with registering or posting jobs, please email industryrelations@colum.edu . Columbia College Chicago homepage Columbia College Chicago Instagram Columbia College Chicago Facebook Columbia College Chicago LinkedIn Columbia College Chicago YouTube Academics Admissions + Financial Aid Student Experience About Careers & Alumni INFO FOR Students Faculty and Staff Parents Alumni Contact Us Academics Schools Majors & Programs Academic Calendar Our Faculty Request Info Admissions + Financial Aid Application Requirements Portfolios and Auditions Financial Aid Scholarships Apply Student Experience Housing Campus Facilities Support Services Student Success Visit About News Events Rankings and Awards Mission and History Report a Concern Careers & Alumni Alumni Success Career Center Industry Opportunities The Alumni Network Give © 2026 Columbia College Chicago Directory Site Map Privacy Policy Accessibility Consumer Information Accreditation Suggest an Edit × ×"
