      "description": "Career Center | Columbia College Chicago Skip to main content Academics Schools Audio and Music Business and Entrepreneurship Communication and Culture Design Fashion Film and Television Theatre and Dance Visual Arts Programs Majors Minors Graduate Certificate Pre-College Programs Immersive Studies Study Abroad Semester in LA Comedy Studies Academic Resources Academic Advising Academic Calendar Catalog Experential Learning Library Our Faculty Student Tools MyColumbia Portal Canvas Engage IT Assistance Student Hub Admissions + Financial Aid Why Choose Columbia? Chicago: Our City and Campus World-Class Facilities Faculty Mentors and Makers Industry Connections Alumni Success Student Work How to Apply Freshman Transfer Graduate International Second Bachelor's Returning Students Nondegree Seeking Portfolio and Audition Requirements Cost + Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate Orientation Visit Us Campus Visits Virtual Tours Student Experience Campus Life Student Center Student Organizations Athletics and Recreation Student Spotlights Events on Campus Manifest Arts Festival Housing + Living Campus Housing Options Office of Housing and Residential Experience Living in Chicago Campus Facilities Campus Map Services + Support Campus Safety and Security Student Health Support Services MyColumbia Portal Information Technology Student Handbook Student Success Student Financial Services Academic Advising Belonging and Persistence Holistic Support Career Outcomes Career Advising Alumni Success Rankings and Awards About About the College Facts Mission and History Rankings and Awards Academic Access and Excellence Strategic Plan Contact Us Leadership Office of the President Office of the Provost Board of Trustees News + Events Columbia Stories Media Mentions Event Spotlight 135th Anniversary Media Resources Careers + Alumni Career Center Internships Job Board Industry Partnerships Alumni Success The Alumni Network Get Info Apply Visit Give Search colum.edu Quick Links MyColumbia Canvas Library Academic Calendar Commencement Campus Map Building Hours Resources For Current Students Prospective Students Parents and Families Student Counselors and Advocates Faculty and Staff Alumni Donors Employers Health + Safety Campus Safety and Security Health Services Center for Student Wellbeing Services for Students with Disabilities Report a Concern Get Connected Give to Columbia Work at Columbia Hire from Columbia Directory Contact Us Get Info Apply Visit Give Search and quick links Open navigation menu Student Overview Student Overview Career Advising Internships Online Job Board On-Campus Employment Career Resources Online Job Board Career Center Students Student Overview Career Advising Internships Online Job Board On-Campus Employment Career Resources Employers Employer Overview Hire from Columbia Fairs & Industry Events Host an Intern for Credit Partner With Us Employer Conduct Alumni Parents & Families Events and Programs Meet the Staff Location Student Center 754 S. Wabash, 3rd Floor 312-369-7280 careercenter@colum.edu Office Hours Monday–Friday 9am–5pm Walk-in Resume Reviews Monday–Friday 10am–4:30pm Make an appointment on ColumWorks Columbia Career Center's job and internship board, ColumWorks , features creative opportunities tailored to our majors and includes, jobs, internships, fellowships, volunteer, freelance, artist residencies, performing arts opportunities, and more. All students and alumni have access to the portal 24/7.  ColumWorks is also the place to make career advising appointments and register for our events. Employers from around the world come to Columbia to recruit, and their openings are posted here. While not exhaustive, it is a the primary source for on-campus employment opportunities and a great resource for internship and entry-level job search. Job seekers should have a number of sites they check regularly in addition to ColumWorks. HOW TO LOG IN Students and alumni can visit colum.12twenty.com to access postings, register for events, or book appointments. Current students will log in using their Columbia SSO (single sign-on) credentials. Once are signed in, you can update your profile, upload your resume, and search for opportunities. Alumni will first need to request an account by submitting the Alumni ColumWorks Request Form . Once they receive email notification to reset their password, they will be able to log in and access services. Account creation can take up to five business days. Need help? Need help logging in? Contact careercenter@colum.edu . Columbia College Chicago homepage Columbia College Chicago Instagram Columbia College Chicago Facebook Columbia College Chicago LinkedIn Columbia College Chicago YouTube Academics Admissions + Financial Aid Student Experience About Careers & Alumni INFO FOR Students Faculty and Staff Parents Alumni Contact Us Academics Schools Majors & Programs Academic Calendar Our Faculty Request Info Admissions + Financial Aid Application Requirements Portfolios and Auditions Financial Aid Scholarships Apply Student Experience Housing Campus Facilities Support Services Student Success Visit About News Events Rankings and Awards Mission and History Report a Concern Careers & Alumni Alumni Success Career Center Industry Opportunities The Alumni Network Give © 2026 Columbia College Chicago Directory Site Map Privacy Policy Accessibility Consumer Information Accreditation Suggest an Edit × ×"
