Alumni Network Get Info Apply Visit Give Search colum.edu Quick Links MyColumbia Canvas Library Academic Calendar Commencement Campus Map Building Hours Resources For Current Students Prospective Students Parents and Families Student Counselors and Advocates Faculty and Staff Alumni Donors Employers Health + Safety Campus Safety and Security Health Services Center for Student Wellbeing Services for Students with Disabilities Report a Concern Get Connected Give to Columbia Work at Columbia Hire from Columbia Directory Contact Us Get Info Apply Visit Give Search and quick links Open navigation menu Office of the Provost Academic Leadership Academic Personnel Academic Policies and Resources Accreditation and Assessment Columbia Core Curriculum Academic Access and Excellence Emeriti Faculty Members Faculty Careers Faculty Development Portfolio Faculty Senate Global Education Institutional Review Board Office of the Registrar Transfer Initiatives and Academic Partnerships About Columbia Office of the Provost Emeriti Faculty Members Emeriti Faculty Members The title “Emeritus” or “Emerita” is bestowed upon those individuals who, while at Columbia, made significant contributions to the culture of their times, in keeping with the college's overall mission. This designation signifies a career marked by vision and leadership, whereby the designee had a marked impact on the lives of those within the Columbia community and actively shaped the future of the college while serving also as a model for professional peers outside of the college. For more information, please visit 445 Emeritus/emerita faculty in the Faculty Manual . Gerald Adams , Ph.D. gadams@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Science Jaafar Aksikas , Ph.D. jaksikas@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Cultural Studies Randall Albers , Ph.D. ralbers@colum.edu Chair Emeritus Fiction/Creative Writing Doreen M. Bartoni , M.F.A. dbartoni@colum.edu Dean Emerita Media Arts Beau Basel Beaudoin , Ph.D. bbeaudoin@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Television Rose L. Blouin , M.A. rblouin@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita English Sharon Bloyd-Peshkin , M.A. speshkin@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Journalism Adam Brooks , M.F.A. abrooks@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Art and Design Ivan Brunetti , B.A. ibrunetti@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Illustration Cari Callis , M.A. ccallis@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Film and Television Luying Chen , Ph.D. lchen@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Humanities Wilfredo Cruz , Ph.D. wcruz@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Humanities Dan Dinello , M.F.A. ddinello@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Film and Video Rami Gabriel , Ph.D. rgabriel@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Social Sciences Diana Gorman Jamrozik dgorman@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita American Sign Language Norma Green , Ph.D. ngreen@colum.edu Professor Emerita Journalism Ann Hetzel Gunkel , Ph.D. agunkel@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Humanities Re'Lynn Hansen , M.A. rhansen@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita English Ann C Hanson , M.S. ahanson@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Mathematics Peter Hartel , B.A. phartel@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Film and Video Deborah Holdstein , Ph.D. dholdstein@colum.edu Professor Emerita English Barbara Iverson , Ph.D. biverson@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Journalism Douglas R. Jones , M.A. djones@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Audio Arts and Acoustics Benjamin Kanters , M.M. bkanters@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Audio Arts and Acoustics Chris Koules , M.F.A. ckoules@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Design Ilya Levinson , Ph.D. ilevinson@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Music Sara Livingston , M.A. slivingston@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Television Carol Lo Verde , B.A. cloverde@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Music Matthew McCurrie , Ph.D. mmccurrie@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus English RoseAnna M. Mueller , Ph.D. rmueller@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Humanities Michael Niederman , M.F.A. mniederman@colum.edu Chair/Professor Emeritus Television Niki Nolin , M.F.A. nnolin@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Interdisciplinary Arts Cecilia O'Reilly , B.A. coreilly@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Theatre Karen L. Osborne , Ph.D. kosborne@colum.edu Professor Emerita English Katie Paciga , Ph.D. kpaciga@colum.edu Professor Emerita Humanities Debra Parr , Ph.D. dparr@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Art History Jackie Penrod , B.F.A. jpenrod@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Theatre Kathleen Perkins , M.F.A. kperkins@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Theatre Kristin Pichaske , Ph.D. kpichaske@gmail.com Associate Professor Emerita Film and Television Teresa Prados-Torreira , Ph.D. tprados-torreira@colum.edu Professor Emerita History Matt Rappaport , M.F.A. mrappaport@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Film and Television J. Dennis Rich , Ph.D. jdrich@colum.edu Chair and Professor Emeritus Arts, Entertainment, and Media Management Mehrnaz Saeedvafa , M.F.A. msaeedvafa@colum.edu Professor Emerita Film and Television Jeff Schiff , Ph.D. jschiff@colum.edu Professor Emeritus English Donald Smith , M.F.A. dsmith@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Film and Television Eunju Sohn , Ph.D. esohn@colum.edu Associate Professor Emerita Mathematics Josef Steiff , M.F.A. jsteiff@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Film and Television Christopher Swider , M.F.A. cswider@colum.edu Professor Emeritus Film and Video Robert Watkins , Ph.D. rwatkins@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Political Science Bobbi Wilsyn bwilsyn@colum.edu Professor of Instruction Emerita Music Gary Yerkins , B.M. gyerkins@colum.edu Professor of Instruction Emeritus Music Peter Xinya Zhang , Ph.D. pzhang@colum.edu Associate Professor Emeritus Audio Arts and Acoustics Office of the Provost Academic Leadership Academic Personnel Academic Policies and Resources Accreditation and Assessment Columbia Core Curriculum Academic 